Package: naturind
Title: Package for assessing the performance of protected area networks
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Kyle J.", "Brumm", , "kbrumm@clemson.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6088-5627"))
Description: Calculates a set of performance indicators for evaluating protected areas and expansion priorities at various spatial extents (e.g., across Europe and within individual biogeographic regions and countries).
